   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the proposed pilot is to enhance the awareness of key public institutions in T&#xfc;rkiye on the EGD, with a focus on corporate sustainability, due diligence, and the social dimensions of the green transition, contributing to alignment with EU frameworks and strengthening T&#xfc;rkiye&apos;s role in EU value chains. 
